{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/82966ffb2543a7c2542a7c36a288595d.webp?t=1775221043\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical card battles and narrative RPG exploration in a world of monsters and anomalies. This is <strong>the Zone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut your way through rabid mutants and supernatural creatures. Collect and use artifacts of mysterious power. Develop your latent abilities and crush your enemies with the force of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/97720b93f47bfe8c6e6be502ea175b85.poster.avif?t=1775221043\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/97720b93f47bfe8c6e6be502ea175b85.webm?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/97720b93f47bfe8c6e6be502ea175b85.mp4?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last remnants of humanity are locked in a desperate battle for survival. Helplessly trapped inside the Zone -- fighting not only against the twisted, hostile environment, but the supernatural fear and confusion that constantly attacks their minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the lucky ones. A 'mutant', cursed with strange telekinetic powers, as well as higher resistance to the Confusion. The kind of person who could thrive out there... If you can stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/8a73ab9f1cefcabce985a7600bdde685.poster.avif?t=1775221043\" width=570 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/8a73ab9f1cefcabce985a7600bdde685.webm?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/8a73ab9f1cefcabce985a7600bdde685.mp4?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your perfect deck by mixing and matching hundreds of pieces of equipment. Carefully manage your expedition to maximise your exploration time. Take on side jobs with unique stories and unique rewards. Make friends. Make enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games such as <i>Slay the Spire</i>, <i>S.T.A.L.K.E.R</i> and <i>Darkest Dungeon</i>, <strong>the Zone</strong> blends a new take on deckbuilding with rich narrative -- a full story crafted by industry veterans (<i>Mount&amp;Blade</i>, <i>The Next World</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/c4294deffe88c58677ef5e8cea37d37f.webp?t=1775221043\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping story, colourful characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful, dangerous world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep inventory management - Assemble your deck and abilities however you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research powerful upgrades for combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete side jobs to gain unique rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different items and abilities to mix and match your perfect playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: <strong>The Zone</strong> contains <i>some</i> AI-assisted art. All such pieces were extensively modified by human artists. The game may also contain AI-generated temp art while in Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considering the negative environmental and societal impact of generative AI, we no longer use it anywhere in our process.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1299540?t=1775221043","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1299540?t=1775221043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/cabdf6a1bf73d86d81fe8e2e63ec1982001d251a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775221043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/cabdf6a1bf73d86d81fe8e2e63ec1982001d251a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775221043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game's story tackles mature topics and may contain references to or descriptions of things like depression, drugs, sex, extreme mental stress, self-harm, etc."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/82966ffb2543a7c2542a7c36a288595d.webp?t=1775221043\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical card battles and narrative RPG exploration in a world of monsters and anomalies. This is <strong>the Zone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut your way through rabid mutants and supernatural creatures. Collect and use artifacts of mysterious power. Develop your latent abilities and crush your enemies with the force of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/97720b93f47bfe8c6e6be502ea175b85.poster.avif?t=1775221043\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/97720b93f47bfe8c6e6be502ea175b85.webm?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/97720b93f47bfe8c6e6be502ea175b85.mp4?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last remnants of humanity are locked in a desperate battle for survival. Helplessly trapped inside the Zone -- fighting not only against the twisted, hostile environment, but the supernatural fear and confusion that constantly attacks their minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the lucky ones. A 'mutant', cursed with strange telekinetic powers, as well as higher resistance to the Confusion. The kind of person who could thrive out there... If you can stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/8a73ab9f1cefcabce985a7600bdde685.poster.avif?t=1775221043\" width=570 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/8a73ab9f1cefcabce985a7600bdde685.webm?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/8a73ab9f1cefcabce985a7600bdde685.mp4?t=1775221043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your perfect deck by mixing and matching hundreds of pieces of equipment. Carefully manage your expedition to maximise your exploration time. Take on side jobs with unique stories and unique rewards. Make friends. Make enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games such as <i>Slay the Spire</i>, <i>S.T.A.L.K.E.R</i> and <i>Darkest Dungeon</i>, <strong>the Zone</strong> blends a new take on deckbuilding with rich narrative -- a full story crafted by industry veterans (<i>Mount&amp;Blade</i>, <i>The Next World</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/extras/c4294deffe88c58677ef5e8cea37d37f.webp?t=1775221043\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping story, colourful characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful, dangerous world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep inventory management - Assemble your deck and abilities however you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research powerful upgrades for combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete side jobs to gain unique rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different items and abilities to mix and match your perfect playstyle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: <strong>The Zone</strong> contains <i>some</i> AI-assisted art. All such pieces were extensively modified by human artists. The game may also contain AI-generated temp art while in Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considering the negative environmental and societal impact of generative AI, we no longer use it anywhere in our process.</p>","developers":["Illuminated Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299540/ba9bbacad939a5f7c8edcd15ef003f21fb416a67/header.jpg?t=1775221043","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright(C) 2023 Illuminated Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1299540/570461/5b278c375a3ee9fb12d8d59e72b007e479a2db9f/1751217705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1684833856","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1299540/570461/5b278c375a3ee9fb12d8d59e72b007e479a2db9f/1751217705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1684833856","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1299540/570461/5b278c375a3ee9fb12d8d59e72b007e479a2db9f/1751217705/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1684833856","id":256948357,"name":"Zone - 2023 EA Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256948357/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1684833856"}],"name":"The Zone: Stalker Stories","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","select